# Cursor AI Rules for Printer Project

## Project Context

This is an AI-powered investment research engine that produces actionable, company-level investment theses through structured reasoning and adversarial testing.

## Technology Stack

- Next.js 14 with TypeScript
- React 18
- Tailwind CSS
- Radix UI components
- Firebase
- OpenAI API

## Code Style

- Use TypeScript for all new files
- Follow React best practices
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Prefer functional components with hooks
- Use proper TypeScript types

## File Organization

- Components go in `src/components/`
- Pages go in `src/app/`
- Utilities go in `src/lib/`
- Types go in `src/types/`

## Terminal Working Directory

The terminal should always start in `/Users/zs/repos/printer`

